  idQuest: 8
  tenNhiemVu: "X\u01B0\u01A1ng Kh\xF4 Khung N\u1ECF"
  loiThoaiNhanQuest: "Trong v\xF9ng ma kh\xED h\u1EBBo l\xE1nh g\u1EA7n s\xE0o huy\u1EC7t
    s\u01A1n t\u1EB7c, \u0111\xE1m o\xE1n h\u1ED3n binh s\u0129 t\u1EED tr\u1EADn
    \u0111\xE3 bi\u1EBFn th\xE0nh qu\xE1i x\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EA7m n\u1ECF. B\u1ECD
    ch\xFAng d\xF9ng t\xEAn \u0111\u1ED9c ma kh\xED v\xF4 c\xF9ng nguy hi\u1EC3m.
    \u0110\u1EA1i hi\u1EC7p h\xE3y gi\u1EA3i tho\xE1t cho nh\u1EEFng t\xE0n linh
    n\xE0y!"
  loiThoaiDangLam: "N\u1ECF ma kh\xED c\xF3 s\u1EE9c s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng r\u1EA5t
    l\u1EDBn. \u0110\u1EA1o h\u1EEFu h\xE3y di chuy\u1EC3n linh ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EC3
    ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t \u0111\u1EE7 15 qu\xE1i x\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EA7m n\u1ECF!"
  loiThoaiHoanThanh: "Nh\u1EEFng m\u0169i t\xEAn o\xE1n \u0111\u1ED9c \u0111\xE3
    ng\u1EEBng bay. C\u1EA3m \u01A1n \u0111\u1EA1i hi\u1EC7p \u0111\xE3 gi\xFAp r\u1EEDa
    s\u1EA1ch ma kh\xED v\xE0 \u0111em l\u1EA1i s\u1EF1 thanh th\u1EA3n cho v\xF9ng
    \u0111\u1EA5t n\xE0y."
